rot.js path / A* (BSD-3-Clause)
================================

This directory vendors a subset of rot.js for Macar party navigation.

Upstream: https://github.com/ondras/rot.js
Pinned commit: 46782e248c2db9d379a5e4f13bb8323f18dff04b
