Vendored source (ES2015 modules, not loaded by the game):
  lib/constants.js
  lib/path/path.js
  lib/path/astar.js

Classic script adaptation (sync <script>, no type="module"):
  rot-path.js — DIRS + Path + AStar only, same algorithm as the pinned
  files. The game must not import the ES modules (deferred modules race
  the first play frame).

Do not replace this with Flare, Shattered Pixel Dungeon, or Brogue
path code.
